n data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-833_">Highest Quality Control</span></h6></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-70dd" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dQEsWe gFKonE pf-834_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:884px" class="sc-deXguC bAaQfZ"><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-835_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-836_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eulNPF VBQcR pf-837_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-839_">FAQs</span></h3><div class="sc-dcJtft hisXnU pf-840_ accordion_block pf-icon-right" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-841_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-842_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="06368316-b73e-4bb6-a4ff-857a73b34771" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Is ThePhotoStick Omni easy to use?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="06368316-b73e-4bb6-a4ff-857a73b34771" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-844_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-845_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-847_">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href="https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/" target="_blank">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-848_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-849_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="18af8c94-daf5-460f-9262-32cd46d37263" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="18af8c94-daf5-460f-9262-32cd46d37263" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-851_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-852_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-854_">Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<i><br></i><sup>*ThePhotoStick Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.<br></sup><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href="/pages/support-system-requirements" target="_self">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-855_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-856_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="7cfe98ef-a8d3-4912-9c08-a3ec735c59c2" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="7cfe98ef-a8d3-4912-9c08-a3ec735c59c2" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-858_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-859_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-861_">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br>512 GB - 204,800 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-862_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-863_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="f3ea34df-c7fc-4d81-89bc-c93a295d6cf6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video files types can ThePhotoStick Omni find and save?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="f3ea34df-c7fc-4d81-89bc-c93a295d6cf6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-865_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-866_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-868_">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MPEG4, but it also saves a vast array of file types as listed below:<br><br><b>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:<br></b>- JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>- HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>- GIF (*.gif)
- PNG (*.png)<br>- BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>- TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)<br>- ICO (*.ico)<br>- Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw)<br>- Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>- PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><b>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</b><br>- MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>- MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>- AVI (*.avi)<br>- WMV (*.wmv)<br>
</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-869_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-870_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="17d3bb6a-69bc-4d8a-bcc7-1d628cd94644" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick Omni as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="17d3bb6a-69bc-4d8a-bcc7-1d628cd94644" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-872_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-873_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-875_">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Omni in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-876_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-877_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="2095af90-10e9-437e-aa76-c1b8c9d941cc" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick Omni come with tech support?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="2095af90-10e9-437e-aa76-c1b8c9d941cc" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-fqkwJk gxNUkH pf-879_"><p class="sc-eifsgl hdULMz pf-880_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fyVeKD hlsaZG pf-882_">Of course! Visit our website, www.thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iGgVNO dygSQz pf-883_"><button type="button" class="sc-eqUzNf hEUCJf pf-884_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="